---
import { EBAY } from "../consts";
---

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why TimeLag</span>
        <h2>Raising the Bar for Retro Game Experiences</h2>
        <p>
          How many times have you bought an item online or at your local retro game store
          only to find out the game wasn&rsquo;t tested, the controller is defective, and the
          console has trouble reading discs?
        </p>
        <p class="lede">TimeLag Video Games takes a different approach!</p>
        <p>
          We carefully curate our selection of video games, accessories and collectibles
          while also specializing in Japanese imports. The items we buy in the PNW and
          Import from across the world are of the highest quality, independently tested by
          multiple sources and fully refurbished to the same quality and reliability you
          would expect to get fresh out of the box!
        </p>
        <p>
          This includes our handhelds and home consoles like Nintendo GameCubes which are
          also region free allowing you to play all your US games and Japanese games.
          You&rsquo;ll also find other nostalgic media and merch from anime and pop culture
          icons around the world.
        </p>
        <p>
          At TimeLag we understand your time is valuable and that you care about having
          clean, high quality and reliable video game items in your collection…
        </p>
        <p>
          Not dust covered, filthy consoles that fail just after the warranty expires
          leaving you frustrated and defeated…
        </p>
        <p class="ko">▶ Avoid the KO.</p>
        <a href={EBAY.storeUrl} class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop TimeLag now ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(1.75rem, 1rem + 3vw, 3.5rem); align-items: start; }
  .about-copy p { margin-bottom: 1rem; max-width: none; }
  .about-copy .lede { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.12rem; }
  /* CTA in this section is the flat pink button */
  .about-copy .btn-primary { background: #f39ccd; color: var(--accent-ink); filter: drop-shadow(0 5px 13px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35)); }
  .about-copy .btn-primary:hover { background: #f6abd5; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)); }
  .ko {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--yellow);
    text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(232, 162, 74, 0.5); font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0.4rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
